# exhaustive-enum-case (#4, store-aware; same-file enum here so no --db needed):
# a case on an enum-typed selector that omits members and has no else. Fires on
# the case missing ckBlue (line 8); NOT on the fully-covered case (line 12) nor the
# case with an else (line 17).
exhaustive-enum-case 8
!exhaustive-enum-case 12
!exhaustive-enum-case 17
